  "markdown": "SYNTHETIC worked output, not model research.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-recommendation\"></a>\nFor dossier, recommended_method is queue-repair.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-both-constraints\"></a>\nFor dossier, eligibility_requirements is finite-shared-chargers, solve-at-most-60-seconds.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-ledger-capacity\"></a>\nFor slot-ledger, models_shared_capacity is true.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-ledger-seconds\"></a>\nFor slot-ledger, corrected_solve_seconds is 84 seconds.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-ledger-ineligible\"></a>\nFor slot-ledger, eligible is false.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-repair-capacity\"></a>\nFor queue-repair, models_shared_capacity is true.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-repair-q1-seconds\"></a>\nFor EV-E-Q1, solve_seconds is 42 seconds.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-repair-q2-seconds\"></a>\nFor EV-E-Q2, solve_seconds is 55 seconds.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-repeat-identity\"></a>\nFor EV-E-Q1, reports is EV-S07, EV-S08, EV-S09.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-independent-count\"></a>\nFor queue-repair, independent_experiment_count is 2 experiments.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-private-seconds\"></a>\nFor private-ledger, solve_seconds is 8 seconds.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-private-exclusion\"></a>\nFor private-ledger, models_shared_capacity is false.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-no-optimum\"></a>\nFor queue-repair, global_optimality_established is false.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-known-inputs\"></a>\nFor shared-methods, demand_assumption is deterministic-known-inputs.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-slot-minutes\"></a>\nFor shared-methods, slot_minutes is 30 minutes.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-charging-assumptions\"></a>\nFor shared-methods, charging_assumptions is whole-wait-slots, lossless-constant-power, truck-and-charger-power-bounds.\n\n<a id=\"claim-claim-B-uncertainty\"></a>\nFor queue-repair, performance_under_uncertain_demand is not-established. This conclusion is withheld because evidence is missing.\n"
